---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AUTHOR, CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN } from '../lib/site';

const UPDATED = 'October 3, 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What data this site processes, and what it does not.">
  <section class="wrap privacy">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Short version: no cookies, no ads, no tracking profiles, no accounts. Last updated {UPDATED}.</p>

    <div class="summary">
      <div class="card"><strong>0</strong><span>cookies</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>0</strong><span>ad or tracking scripts</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>0</strong><span>third-party fonts</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>
      This site is run by {AUTHOR.name} as a personal, non-commercial blog. For any privacy question or request, contact me via{' '}
      {
        AUTHOR.socials.map((s, i) => (
          <>
            {i > 0 && ' or '}
            <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {s.label}
            </a>
          </>
        ))
      }.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare. To deliver pages and protect the site from abuse, Cloudflare processes technical request
      data such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, and may keep it in short-lived logs. Cloudflare acts as a
      data processor; see the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.
      The legal basis is legitimate interest in running a secure website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    {
      CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN ? (
        <p>
          Visits are counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics. It sets no cookies, does not use local storage and does not build
          profiles of visitors; it only reports aggregate numbers such as page views, referrers and countries.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>The site currently runs no analytics script. Only Cloudflare's aggregate request counts exist.</p>
      )
    }

    <h2>Live share prices</h2>
    <p>
      Some studies show current share prices. Your browser asks this site's own server for them, and the server fetches the
      prices from Yahoo Finance. Your IP address is not passed on to Yahoo.
    </p>

    <h2>Stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      If you switch between light and dark mode, the choice is saved in your browser's local storage under the key
      <code>theme</code>. It never leaves your device and you can clear it at any time in your browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Fonts and external links</h2>
    <p>
      All fonts are served from this site, so no font requests go to Google or other providers. Links to LinkedIn, Instagram and
      data sources open those sites, whose own privacy policies apply once you visit them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR you can ask for access to, correction or deletion of your personal data, and you can lodge a complaint with
      your data protection authority. This site itself stores no personal data about visitors beyond the hosting logs described
      above.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding-top: 48px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.3em 0.75em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-1), var(--accent-2));
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 1.5em 0 1em;
  }
  .summary .card {
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .summary strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .summary span {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .summary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
